+# GitHub Actions example: obtain AWS credentials via OIDC and sign artifact with cosign KMS
+
+Example workflow step (place in your signing job):
+
+```yaml
+name: Sign artifact
+on: workflow_dispatch
+permissions:
+  id-token: write
+  contents: read
+jobs:
+  sign:
+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
+    steps:
+      - name: Checkout
+        uses: actions/checkout@v4
+      - name: Configure AWS credentials via OIDC
+        uses: aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v2
+        with:
+          role-to-assume: arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/aegis-ci-cosign-role
+          aws-region: us-west-2
+      - name: Sign with cosign (KMS)
+        run: |
+          curl -sSL -o /usr/local/bin/cosign https://github.com/sigstore/cosign/releases/download/v1.15.0/cosign-linux-amd64
+          chmod +x /usr/local/bin/cosign
+          cosign sign --key "awskms://alias/aegis-cosign" path/to/artifact.tar.gz
+```
